#: ../../entities/innospring.rst:1
msgid "InnoSpring / SITRI incubation ecosystem"
msgstr "新微创源／上海微技术工研院孵化生态"

#: ../../entities/innospring.rst:4
msgid "新微创源／上海微技术工研院孵化生态"
msgstr "新微创源／上海微技术工研院孵化生态"

#: ../../entities/innospring.rst:6
msgid "Incubator | Jiading | Research checked 2026-11-04"
msgstr "孵化器｜嘉定区｜资料核查日期 2026-11-04"

#: ../../entities/innospring.rst:8
msgid "AI and industry focus: Hardware AI, Chips, Sensors."
msgstr "AI及产业方向：AI硬件、芯片、传感器。"

#: ../../entities/innospring.rst:10
msgid ""
"The municipal science commission records joint work between InnoSpring "
"and SITRI. This is a route for beyond-Moore technology, shared technical "
"services and pilot production rather than a promise of free fabrication."
msgstr "上海市科委公开资料介绍了新微创源与工研院在科研、中试和孵化方面的协作，可关注超越摩尔技术及公共技术服务。对接平台不代表可以免费流片。"

#: ../../entities/innospring.rst:12
msgid ""
"`Evidence S006 "
"<https://stcsm.sh.gov.cn/xwzx/gzdt/20240510/992800bb77b6492b97ba4a9c14c09944.html>`_. "
"市科委、嘉定区联合调研高质量孵化器建设工作."
msgstr "`资料来源 S006 <https://stcsm.sh.gov.cn/xwzx/gzdt/20240510/992800bb77b6492b97ba4a9c14c09944.html>`_. 市科委、嘉定区联合调研高质量孵化器建设工作."

#: ../../entities/innospring.rst:14
msgid "Status and support"
msgstr "项目状态与支持内容"

#: ../../entities/innospring.rst:17
msgid "Published entity; intake to confirm"
msgstr "机构信息已核实，当前是否接受申请需确认"

#: ../../entities/innospring.rst:19
msgid ""
"No standard cash award, fee waiver or equity percentage is verified for "
"this entry. Request the current written offer."
msgstr "尚未确认统一的现金资助额度、费用减免或股权比例，请向运营机构索取最新书面方案。"

#: ../../entities/innospring.rst:21
msgid "Contact and location"
msgstr "联系方式与地址"

#: ../../entities/innospring.rst:24
msgid ""
"`Official evidence and authority route "
"<https://stcsm.sh.gov.cn/xwzx/gzdt/20240510/992800bb77b6492b97ba4a9c14c09944.html>`_"
msgstr "`官方资料及主管部门 <https://stcsm.sh.gov.cn/xwzx/gzdt/20240510/992800bb77b6492b97ba4a9c14c09944.html>`_"

#: ../../entities/innospring.rst:26
msgid ""
"Use the official website to request the responsible team and current "
"application route. Email addresses are not reproduced in this publication."
msgstr "请通过官网咨询具体负责部门及最新申请方式。本图谱不公开电子邮箱地址。"

#: ../../entities/innospring.rst:28
msgid ""
"Map position uses a district or campus anchor; it is not a verified "
"office location."
msgstr "地图采用行政区或校区参考点，不代表已核实的办公地址。"

#: ../../entities/innospring.rst:30
msgid "Application workflow"
msgstr "申请流程"

#: ../../entities/innospring.rst:33
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "以下步骤为本书整理的申请参考，实际办理流程以最新官方通知或协议为准。"

#: ../../entities/innospring.rst:35
msgid ""
"Describe the prototype, required equipment, process and testing needs."
msgstr "介绍样机，列明设备、工艺及测试需求。"

#: ../../entities/innospring.rst:37
msgid "Ask for a technical review, facility visit and itemized quotation."
msgstr "申请技术评估和设施参观，并索取分项报价。"

#: ../../entities/innospring.rst:39
msgid ""
"Agree access, safety, sample and IP ownership, test scope and acceptance."
msgstr "约定使用权限、安全责任、样品及知识产权归属、测试范围和验收标准。"

#: ../../entities/innospring.rst:41
msgid ""
"Separate the facility contract from investment or public-funding "
"applications."
msgstr "设施服务合同与投资、财政资助分别办理。"

#: ../../entities/innospring.rst:43
msgid ":doc:`Jiading district route </districts/jiading>`"
msgstr ":doc:`嘉定区合作指南 </districts/jiading>`"

